# A merge commit records both parents and the spec message.
I definitions.inc
> init
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<
+ g.txt notwug.txt
> add g.txt
<<<
> commit "m1"
<<<
> checkout other
<<<
+ h.txt wug.txt
> add h.txt
<<<
> commit "o1"
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
<<<
= h.txt wug.txt
= g.txt notwug.txt
> log
===
commit [a-f0-9]+
Merge: [a-f0-9]{7} [a-f0-9]{7}
${DATE}
Merged other into master.

${ARBLINES}
<<<*
